---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, fullAddress } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for A to Z Wallpapers & Interiors — how we handle enquiry data, analytics and cookies (India DPDP-aware)."
>
  <section class="section-pad">
    <article class="container-site prose-site max-w-3xl">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p>Effective: {site.legal.privacyEffective}. Business: {site.name}, {fullAddress()}.</p>
      <h2>Data we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit a form we collect name, phone, optional email and project details, plus attribution fields
        (UTM parameters, click IDs, landing page, referrer) stored in your browser session and sent with the enquiry.
      </p>
      <h2>How we use data</h2>
      <p>
        To respond to enquiries, provide quotes and improve our services. We do not sell personal data.
        Owner email / WhatsApp alerts: TODO-CONFIRM contact channels in site.ts.
      </p>
      <h2>Cookies & analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Marketing and analytics tags (GTM / GA4 / Ads / Bing UET / Meta) load only after you accept the consent banner.
        You can reject analytics cookies; essential session storage for form attribution may still work.
      </p>
      <h2>Retention & rights</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiry rows are retained in our Google Sheet until deleted by the business. To request access or deletion,
        contact us via the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> (email TODO-CONFIRM).
      </p>
      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>Google (Sheets / Apps Script / optional analytics), WhatsApp click-to-chat, and optional CallMeBot if enabled.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
